---
import SolutionPage from '../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Environmental Health"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Your environment is dictating your biology 24/7 whether you notice or not."
  slug="environment"
>
  <!-- ── Why this matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Light, air, water, EMF, and grounding are high-leverage biological inputs — they change the dose-response of every other protocol you run</li>
    <li>Modern indoor environments are poorly matched to human biology: artificial light suppresses melatonin, tap water delivers endocrine disruptors, indoor air routinely exceeds outdoor pollution levels</li>
    <li>Small, targeted environmental interventions produce compounding benefit across every 4M pillar — sleep, cognition, hormones, and gut health all improve downstream</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Two Paths to Act ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Two Paths to Act</h2>
  <div class="two-paths-grid">
    <div class="path-card path-otc">
      <div class="path-badge">Shop by Category</div>
      <h3>Environmental Products</h3>
      <p class="path-price">Protocol-matched, curated</p>
      <p>Explore the five environmental sub-categories below — each has protocol details and curated product recommendations for that specific exposure type.</p>
      <a href="#environment-categories" class="btn-sol primary">Browse Categories →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="path-card path-rx">
      <div class="path-badge path-badge-rx">Personalized Protocol</div>
      <h3>Comprehensive 4M Consult</h3>
      <p class="path-price">Full environmental + supplement review</p>
      <p>For a personalized environmental and supplement protocol matched to your living situation, exposures, labs, and the rest of your 4M plan.</p>
      <a href="/consult" class="btn-sol secondary">Schedule 4M Consult →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── When to choose which ── -->
  <div class="when-strip">
    <div class="when-col">
      <div class="when-label">Start with products when:</div>
      <p>You know the exposure you want to address (light, air, water, EMF, or grounding) and want curated recommendations without a full consult.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="when-divider"></div>
    <div class="when-col">
      <div class="when-label">Book a consult when:</div>
      <p>You want a personalized environmental audit matched to your supplement stack, labs, and full 4M protocol — not just product picks.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Protégé footer card ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    <strong>Want the deeper protocol?</strong> The 4M Protégé program includes a full environmental audit as part of your Mitigate pillar onboarding — light, air, water, EMF, and grounding assessed and prioritized for your specific situation. <a href="/consult">Learn about Protégé →</a>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Environmental sub-categories ── -->
  <h2 id="environment-categories">Explore by Category</h2>
  <p>Each factor has its own dedicated solution page with protocol details and curated products.</p>
  <div class="env-grid">
    <a href="/solutions/environment/light" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">☀</div>
      <h3>Light</h3>
      <p>Circadian-friendly bulbs, blue-blockers, red-light therapy, and morning light protocols.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Light →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/air" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">💨</div>
      <h3>Air</h3>
      <p>HEPA + carbon filtration, mold testing, and indoor air quality interventions.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Air →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/water" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">💧</div>
      <h3>Water</h3>
      <p>Reverse osmosis, whole-home filtration, shower filters, and replacement schedules.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Water →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/emf" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>EMF</h3>
      <p>Shielding bedding, faraday cases, low-EMF routers, and distance-based strategies.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore EMF →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/solutions/environment/grounding" class="env-card">
      <div class="env-icon">🌿</div>
      <h3>Grounding</h3>
      <p>Sleep mats, floor mats, grounding patches, and outdoor grounding protocols.</p>
      <span class="env-cta">Explore Grounding →</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Condensed Insulting Behaviors ── -->
  <h2>The Insulting Behaviors</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>LED overhead lighting in the bedroom and living areas all night — blue-spectrum suppresses melatonin production</li>
    <li>Drinking unfiltered tap water — fluoride, chlorine, PFAS, and microplastics delivered daily</li>
    <li>Constant EMF immersion — router in the bedroom, phone in the pocket all day, sleeping next to chargers</li>
    <li>Feet never touching earth — modern footwear and flooring eliminate grounding, a measurable anti-inflammatory input</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="read-more-link">Read more: Eliminate the Insulting Behavior — Environment →</a></p>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.two-paths-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin: 1.25rem 0;
}
.path-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}
.path-card.path-rx {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  border-width: 2px;
}
.path-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.35);
  padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
}
.path-badge.path-badge-rx {
  color: var(--primary);
  background: rgba(26,54,93,0.08);
  border-color: rgba(26,54,93,0.3);
}
.path-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.path-price {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.path-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0; }
.path-card .btn-sol { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
.when-strip {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .when-strip { flex-direction: column; }
  .when-divider { display: none; }
}
.when-col { flex: 1; }
.when-divider { width: 1px; background: var(--border); }
.when-label {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
}
.when-col p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0; }
.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.06) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0 0 2rem;
}
.protege-card a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.protege-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* 5-card environment grid */
.env-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
}
.env-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
}
.env-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,184,148,0.12);
}
.env-icon {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
}
.env-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.env-card p {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin: 0;
  flex: 1;
}
.env-cta {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.read-more-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.read-more-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
